    <description><![CDATA[<p>#Plot Equations</p>
<h2 id="tecplot">Tecplot</h2>
<div class="details admonition tip">
        <div class="details-summary admonition-title">
            <i class="icon fas fa-lightbulb fa-fw"></i>对于 Visit导出数据<i class="details-icon fas fa-angle-right fa-fw"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="details-content">
            <div class="admonition-content">若要使用Visit导出的三维数据求ddx,ddy,ddz，则必须先在Visit中对场切块，否则导出的坐标格式为I,J,K。</div>
        </div>
    </div>
<h3 id="q准则">Q准则</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">{Q}=-1/2*((ddx(v4))**2+(ddy(v5))**2+(ddz(v6))**2)-ddy(v4)*ddx(v5)-ddz(v4)*ddx(v6)-ddz(v5)*ddy(v6)
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h3 id="liutex">Liutex</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">{B2}=1/2*((ddy(v4)-ddx(v5))**2+(ddz(v4)-ddx(v6))**2+(ddz(v5)-ddy(v6))**2)
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">{A2}=(ddx(v4))**2+1/2*(ddy(v6)+ddz(v5))**2+(ddy(v5))**2+1/2*(ddz(v4)+ddx(v6))**2+(ddz(v6))**2+1/2*(ddx(v5)+ddy(v4))**2
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">{Liutex}={B2}/({A2}+{B2})
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h2 id="visit">Visit</h2>
<h3 id="tke">TKE</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">TKE=0.5*(VAR_U-MEAN_U^2+VAR_V-MEAN_V^2+VAR_W-MEAN_W^2)
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><h3 id="uuuc2">u’u’/Uc^2</h3>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span></code></pre></td>
